Package: iOrganoAssay
Type: Package
Title: iOrganoAssay Shiny Application for Mouse Intestinal Organoid Image Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Sung-Wook",
                  family = "Nam",
                  email = "nams@knu.ac.kr",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: iOrganoAssay (images of Organoid Assay) bundles an interactive
    Shiny application for connecting microscopy images of mouse intestinal
    organoids (mIOs) with downstream assay data. The application provides
    an Analysis tab for daily-based monitoring of organoid morphology
    (mean +/- SD line plots and violin plots by mouse line, passage,
    microwell, day, and treatment) and a Validation tab for evaluating
    segmentation quality using Dice score, accuracy, segmentation error,
    and centroid error. The package bundles the Shiny app inside R so
    that users can launch it directly from R/RStudio without copying or
    pasting any script.
